Package: CAs
Type: Package
Title: Creating Covering Arrays
Version: 0.24-3
Authors@R: person(given = "Ulrike",
                    family = "Groemping",
                    role = c("aut", "cre"),
                    email = "ulrike.groemping@bht-berlin.de")
Description: Implements covering arrays, as proposed in 
    Groemping (2025) <doi:10.1109/ICSTW64639.2025.10962463>. 
    Mathematical constructions of covering arrays are provided, 
    as detailed at <https://github.com/ugroempi/CAs>. Both uniform 
    and mixed-level covering arrays are created and can be assessed 
    for their coverage properties. The creation of mixed-level arrays 
    according to Groemping (2025) 
    <https://www1.bht-berlin.de/FB_II/reports/Report-2025-001.pdf> 
    relies heavily on the post-processing method by Nayeri, Colbourn 
    and Konjevod (2013) <doi:10.1016/j.ejc.2012.07.017>. 
    There are also preliminary tools for the creation of sequence 
    covering arrays.
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
